#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:1
#: d4823b452dd24db9806c4c567c78e46e
msgid "按索引精确选中一批结构"
msgstr "Select Structures Precisely by Index"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:3
#: bc079932f08747e39d6d2366ecc6124c
msgid ""
"已经从日志、训练结果或外部脚本拿到结构编号时，不必在散点图里逐个点选。`Select by Index` "
"可以一次选中离散编号和连续切片，适合复核、导出或删除一批已知结构。"
msgstr ""
"When structure indices already come from a log, training result, or external"
" script, you do not need to click points one by one. `Select by Index` "
"accepts both individual indices and slices, making it useful for reviewing, "
"exporting, or removing a known set of structures."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:5
#: 5451b97c9ca94da6b66033730002b5ae
msgid "输入编号"
msgstr "Enter the Indices"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:7
#: 5464e748dc7743a1845b6c2d19b1758e
msgid "打开数据后，点击工具栏中的 `Select by Index`。"
msgstr "After loading the data, click `Select by Index` on the toolbar."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:9
#: a9da1f45c8cc49d6b03e696aabe3727c
msgid "按索引选择结构的入口"
msgstr "Entry point for selecting structures by index"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:9
#: a9da1f45c8cc49d6b03e696aabe3727c
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:14
#: a5a756d6abf04691aeb2c92a0fb07b1c
msgid "在弹窗中输入 `0, 5, 10:13`："
msgstr "Enter `0, 5, 10:13` in the dialog:"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:16
#: 8c788aa034314e3d833befb4f5a43244
msgid "按索引选择结构设置"
msgstr "Index selection settings"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:16
#: 8c788aa034314e3d833befb4f5a43244
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_index_dialog.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_index_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:21
#: fc330e96ec0a4281b8b17c548c7762c4
msgid ""
"这里的编号从 `0` 开始，切片右端不包含在内，因此实际选中 `0、5、10、11、12`，共 5 个结构。逗号用于分隔多段输入，`10:13` "
"的写法与 Python 切片一致。"
msgstr ""
"Indices start at `0`, and the right endpoint of a slice is excluded. This "
"expression therefore selects `0, 5, 10, 11, 12`, for a total of five "
"structures. Commas separate entries, and `10:13` follows Python slice "
"syntax."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:23
#: e9c8dc913ed3480a86afda6b3a4f49fd
msgid ""
"一般保持 `Use original indices` "
"勾选。这样即使之前筛选或删除过结构，编号仍对应最初载入文件时的顺序；取消勾选后，编号指当前活动结构列表中的位置。"
msgstr ""
"Usually keep `Use original indices` enabled. The indices then refer to the "
"order in the originally loaded file even after filtering or deletion. When "
"disabled, they refer to positions in the current active-structure list."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:25
#: 05084051169d429996e3e4a71feeda7b
msgid "核对再处理"
msgstr "Verify Before Processing"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:27
#: 8500cebd5020437e8797c135edc47d6c
msgid "按索引选中五个结构后的界面"
msgstr "Five structures selected by index"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:27
#: 8500cebd5020437e8797c135edc47d6c
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:32
#: 05523455e5834577bc79eb03cf16de8e
msgid ""
"确认底部状态栏显示 `Sel: "
"5`，再用右下角的结构编号逐个查看。后续可以只导出选中结构，也可以删除或继续分析。若编号来自另一个文件，先确认两个文件的结构顺序一致；仅凭编号相同不能说明结构相同。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the status bar shows `Sel: 5`, then inspect the structures one "
"by one with the index control at the lower right. You can export only the "
"selection, remove it, or continue the analysis. If the indices came from "
"another file, first verify that both files use the same structure order; "
"matching indices alone do not imply matching structures."
